====Climate in Ishijima====
Ishijima occupies the latitude band between 14°S and 19°S. The climate transitions from tropical monsoon in the north to [[w:Humid subtropical climate|humid subtropical]] (''Cfa'') in the south. The island's mountainous interior creates distinct microclimates, with eastern, trade-exposed slopes receiving up to 2,500 mm of rainfall annually while western coastal areas in the rain shadow receive as little as 1,200–1,500 mm. Summer temperatures reach 30–33°C, while winter temperatures rarely fall below 15°C, making the island warm throughout the year.

